    "text": "NBC News\nwebsite\nRuidoso\nNew Mexico river rose 18 feet in just 30 minutes turning deadly\n4 hours ago\nRaging floodwaters in Ruidoso in southern New Mexico killed at least three people, including two children overnight according to authorities. Officials confirmed a Fort Bliss soldier and their spouse are in the hospital with serious injuries and that their two children are among the dead. NBC News’ Steve Patterson reports on a community reckoning with the fury of deadly floodwaters, taking stock of anything left.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
